  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mid-Term Review AGRI-CONNECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The main objectives of this evaluation are to provide the relevant services of the European Union, the Government of Tanzania the programme&#xbf;s Steering Committee members and all implementing partners:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;an overall independent assessment of the performance of the AGRI-CONNECT programme&lt;em&gt;,&lt;/em&gt; paying particular attention to its different levels of results measured against its expected objectives; and the reasons underpinning such results&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;key lessons learned, conclusions and related recommendations in order to improve current and future interventions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In particular, this evaluation will serve&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- to measure progress to date, against initial objectives and expected results;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- to explain why progress is happening, or is not happening as planned;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- to provide recommendations on priorities measures to improve the programme during its residual duration in order to achieve the expected objectives, taking into account problems and opportunities, as well as on the opportunity of having a no-cost extension of the programme;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- to provide specific recommendations for the exit strategy of each implement partner, in view of ensuring that their local partners, target or beneficiaries can take full advantage of the support received;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;The main users of this evaluation will be the EU Delegation to Tanzania and other relevant services of the European Union, the Government of Tanzania, the programme&#xbf;s Steering Committee members and all AGRI-CONNECT&#xbf;s implementing partners.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
